{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c503","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0761f-a1d7-7f21-bbcd-d353d9bc9dd9"},"sequence":220,"recorded_at":1780531400000435,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"357b4990-0035-4254-a95a-ceb9ed1d0622","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"357b4990-0035-4254-a95a-ceb9ed1d0622","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"357b4990-0035-4254-a95a-ceb9ed1d0622"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"5000eeec-2c69-4be7-b9eb-04b3747b007e"},"task_id":"5000eeec-2c69-4be7-b9eb-04b3747b007e","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"5000eeec-2c69-4be7-b9eb-04b3747b007e","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-11-1\",\n  \"command\": \"git diff | head -n 40; echo \\\"===\\\"; gh pr view 35 --json state,headRefOid,title,url 2>&1 | head -n 20; echo \\\"===\\\"; git log --oneline -3\",\n  \"description\": \"Inspect LOGBOOK delta and PR state\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"diff --git a/LOGBOOK.md b/LOGBOOK.md\\nindex fd2a806..e3fb383 100644\\n--- a/LOGBOOK.md\\n+++ b/LOGBOOK.md\\n@@ -5,6 +5,15 @@\\n \\n ## 2026-09-06\\n \\n+### 1347 — Shared-environment boundary leaf: one library plus fail-closed agreement battery\\n+- SCOPE: TASK-260830-3bkz0c (third/final leaf of STORY-260830-3drr2m). New package `internal/environ` (decode.go, tuple.go, observation.go, doc.go): single strict-frame decoder with string-walk surrogate semantics, rune measure, env-id/SemVer/arch grammars, exact six-member Tuple, §10.8.1 Environment Observation reusing the tuple model. Battery: census, frame/measure/tuple/identity agreement, observation. Frozen `sessadapter`/`dirnode` production untouched. Commit afdba1d (signed), PR #35 published.\\n+- FINDING: sessadapter+dirnode raw-scan surrogate gates REFUSE wire bodies carrying literal backslash-u text (`cursor` value `\\\\ud800` text) while environ+provhost+canonicaljson string-walk gates ACCEPT — proven via DecodeTuple/CheckScanRequest/Canonicalize. sessadapter `TestSurrogateGateAgreesWithCanonicalJSON` is one-directional (`!localRefuses && sharedRefuses`) and hides exactly this class. Ledgered in frame_agreement_test.go; unifying the frozen scanners is the recorded follow-up.\\n+- FINDING: truncated/malformed escapes refuse at the surrogate arm (raw scan) vs the syntax arm (string walk); wrong identity schema/version refuses at the member arm (provhost) vs the dispatch registry (canonicaljson). Same verdicts, different arms — ledgered per-judge, not papered over.\\n+- FINDING: battery caught its author's parity error — run-3 backslashes (`\\\\\\\\\\\\ud800`) are a real lone escape (odd runs escape, even runs quote), not divergence; row corrected to all-refuse before green.\\n+- EVIDENCE: attached TASK-260830-3bkz0c_boundary.md (7/7 AC rows with call sites) + TASK-260830-3bkz0c_mutation-log.md. Narrowing mutants 6/6 killed (N1/N2/N3/N4/N6 + token-preserving T1 raw-scan rewrite with census still green); D1 delete-only killed, scored as existence only. Tree sha-verified identical post-battery.\\n+- GATES: `go test ./... -count=1` exit 0 (19 pkgs), environ `-race` exit 0, cover 76.1%, `go vet ./...` + `GOOS=windows go vet ./...` exit 0, gofmt clean, `tracecheck` exit 0 (unchanged), catalog generate no-diff, `go build ./...` exit 0.\\n+- STATUS: Ready for review, handed off with CR published (review/landing are orchestrator steps).\\n+\\n ### 1035 — Directory-node leaf round-2 rework: rev1 B1/B2/B3 closed, 185-mutant battery\\n \\n - SCOPE: TASK-260830-ljkj8r round-2 rework (review-verdict-rev1, changes requested, B1–B3 blocking). Test-only additions inside `internal/dirnode/` (`bound_census_test.go`, `bounds_edge_test.go`, `query_operations_test.go`, `arm_identity_test.go`) plus four one-line fixture-surgery fixes (`query_test.go` unknown_field + missing caller, `manifest_test.go` missing member, `probe_test.go` missing member) and three edge extensions (findings 4097, cursor 1/1024 admission, projection bound edges). No production behavior change. Uncommitted per the CR-shape instruction.\\n===\\n{\\\"headRefOid\\\":\\\"afdba1dd35c7c8f09d8d943ed15c217fe69dabfb\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"OPEN\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"STORY-260830-3drr2m: session-adapter-and-directory-node-framework\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/pull/35\\\"}\\n===\\nafdba1d TASK-260830-3bkz0c: TASK-260830-3bkz0c: prove-shared-environment-implementation-boundary\\nd5ad5f6 TASK-260830-ljkj8r: TASK-260830-ljkj8r: implement-directory-node-protocol-host\\n7c25ae0 TASK-260830-2z3se0: TASK-260830-2z3se0: implement-session-adapter-protocol-host\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3557,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 890,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
